<div data-cgap-sector="Commercial Kitchens &amp; Hospitality" data-cgap-term="kitchen"></div><p class="lead">A kitchen has a dozen different hazards in thirty feet: hot oil at the fryer, a conveyor oven that does not stop for fingers, CO2 tanks in a closet, a walk-in door that can trap someone, and chemicals at the dish machine. One &quot;Caution Hot&quot; sign does not cover it.</p><p>These signs are written station by station, so a new cook reads the right instruction at the right spot: how to drain and filter the fryer, how to clear a jam on the pizza conveyor, where the walk-in release is, and what not to mix at the dish machine. They wipe clean and stand up to steam and grease.</p><h2>What to post, and where</h2><div class="il-areas"><div class="il-area"><h3>Conveyor pizza oven</h3><p>60 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall or oven side panel at eye level next to the oven.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-conveyor-pizza-oven-sign-cgap-c04020-812">Conveyor Pizza Oven</a></li><li><span data-s="NOTICE">NOTICE</span><a href="/products/notice-conveyor-pizza-oven-cool-down-sign-cgap-n04290-812">Conveyor Pizza Oven Cool-Down</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-conveyor-pizza-oven-exit-sign-cgap-i04695-812">Conveyor Pizza Oven Exit</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-pizza-oven-entrance-sign-cgap-c04155-812">Pizza Oven Entrance</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Combi oven</h3><p>36 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the front of the combi oven near the door handle for use after a cleaning or cool down cycle.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-combi-oven-cooling-down-door-sign-cgap-c22560-812">Combi Oven Cooling Down Door</a></li><li><span data-s="WARNING">WARNING</span><a href="/products/warning-combi-oven-steam-release-sign-cgap-w00689-812">Combi Oven Steam Release</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-combi-oven-door-sign-cgap-i05299-812">Combi Oven Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-combi-oven-door-glass-sign-cgap-c06309-812">Combi Oven Door Glass</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Kitchen exhaust hood and grease duct</h3><p>33 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the hood face next to the filter bank.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hood-grease-filters-sign-cgap-c17120-812">Hood Grease Filters</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-kitchen-exhaust-hood-sign-cgap-i12503-812">Kitchen Exhaust Hood</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hood-baffle-filter-edges-sign-cgap-c17253-812">Hood Baffle Filter Edges</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-hood-filter-slot-sign-cgap-c17386-812">Hood Filter Slot</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Deep fryer and oil filtration</h3><p>31 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the cabinet door or side of the fryer next to the filter pan opening.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-filter-pan-handle-sign-cgap-c01124-812">Fryer Filter Pan Handle</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-filter-pan-cart-sign-cgap-c01259-812">Fryer Filter Pan Cart</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-basket-handles-sign-cgap-c01394-812">Fryer Basket Handles</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-fryer-basket-rest-bar-sign-cgap-c01529-812">Fryer Basket Rest Bar</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Mixer and dough sheeter</h3><p>27 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the wall above the flour bag stack.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-flour-bag-storage-sign-cgap-c10080-812">Flour Bag Storage</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-ingredient-staging-sign-cgap-c10215-812">Mixer Ingredient Staging</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-bowl-wash-area-sign-cgap-c10350-812">Mixer Bowl Wash Area</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-mixer-safety-shield-sign-cgap-c10485-812">Mixer Safety Shield</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Walk-in cooler or freezer</h3><p>26 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the cooler door at eye level, outside near the handle.</p><ul><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-walk-in-cooler-door-sign-cgap-i14110-812">Walk-In Cooler Door</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-walk-in-interior-light-sign-cgap-i14244-812">Walk-In Interior Light</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-walk-in-freezer-entry-sign-cgap-i14378-812">Walk-In Freezer Entry</a></li><li><span data-s="SAFETY FIRST">SAFETY FIRST</span><a href="/products/safety-first-walk-in-freezer-cold-gear-sign-cgap-i14512-812">Walk-In Freezer Cold Gear</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>CO2 beverage system</h3><p>25 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: Mount on the lowest overhead pipe or beam in the cellar aisle.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-beverage-cellar-ceiling-sign-cgap-c10081-812">Beverage Cellar Ceiling</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-beverage-cellar-floor-sign-cgap-c10216-812">Beverage Cellar Floor</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-keg-handling-sign-cgap-c10351-812">Keg Handling</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-keg-rack-sign-cgap-c10486-812">Keg Rack</a></li></ul></div><div class="il-area"><h3>Dish machine and chemical dispenser</h3><p>25 signs written for this equipment. Typical spot: On the front of the door type dish machine at face height.</p><ul><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-dish-machine-door-sign-cgap-c12774-812">Dish Machine Door</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-dish-machine-exit-table-sign-cgap-c13109-812">Dish Machine Exit Table</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-dish-machine-rack-entry-sign-cgap-c13244-812">Dish Machine Rack Entry</a></li><li><span data-s="CAUTION">CAUTION</span><a href="/products/caution-dish-machine-curtain-sign-cgap-c13379-812">Dish Machine Curtain</a></li></ul></div></div><h2>Common questions</h2><div class="il-faq"><details><summary>What safety signs does a restaurant kitchen need?</summary><p>Start with the fryer and oil filtration, the hood and fire pull station, the walk-in cooler release, the CO2 or beverage gas storage, and the dish machine chemical station. The Sign Finder lists signs for each of these by install point.</p></details><details><summary>Are these signs easy to clean?</summary><p>Yes. They are printed aluminum, so grease and steam wipe off with a normal kitchen degreaser.</p></details><details><summary>Do you have signs for pizza ovens and bakeries?</summary><p>Yes, including conveyor pizza ovens, wood-fired ovens, mixers and dough sheeters. Search the machine name to see them.</p></details></div><script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "What safety signs does a restaurant kitchen need?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Start with the fryer and oil filtration, the hood and fire pull station, the walk-in cooler release, the CO2 or beverage gas storage, and the dish machine chemical station. The Sign Finder lists signs for each of these by install point."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Are these signs easy to clean?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. They are printed aluminum, so grease and steam wipe off with a normal kitchen degreaser."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do you have signs for pizza ovens and bakeries?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes, including conveyor pizza ovens, wood-fired ovens, mixers and dough sheeters. Search the machine name to see them."}}]}</script>